  "description": "The Attention is the kind of bike that'll redefine your expectations. Available in both 27.5in and 29er versions, depending on frame size, you're guaranteed to find the perfect fit. Building on this ergonomic foundation, we selected components renowned for their performance and value. New for 2019, we've even redesigned the rear end to make it easier than ever to attach a luggage carrrier and mudguards for a sleek, integrated look and the added versatility of a day-to-day commuter or weekend tourer. With a Shimano 3x10 speed transmission - including an XT rear derailleur - and a smooth, easily adjustable RockShox suspension fork, we've created a versatile hardtail that'll slot right into your active lifestyle.",
